        "en": "Joined by a Path",
        "zh-CN": "道路连通（两点相连）"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Type),Type.annotation(@x,X),Type.annotation(@y,X)),def(Joined(x,y), , ))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Two points $x,y\\in X$ are **joined by a path** if there exists a path $f\\colon I\\to X$ with $f(0)=x$ and $f(1)=y$; this relation is an equivalence relation.",
          "zh-CN": "若存在道路 $f\\colon I\\to X$ 使 $f(0)=x$ 且 $f(1)=y$，则称 $x,y\\in X$ 可由道路相连；该关系是等价关系。"
        }
      }
    },
